DESCRIPTION:BWMCA Presents: Annual Jazz in the Park Buderim Join us for an 
 afternoon of sizzling hot Jazz entertainment! Listen to the captivating pe
 rformances showcasing our local talent on the Sunshine Coast. The afternoo
 n starts with the next generation of Jazz Musicians on the Coast - The Sun
 shine Coast Grammar School Band followed by The Dean Doyle Quartet and the
  Grand Finale presented by the hugely popular June Garber Quintet . Don’
 t miss out on this wonderful event! Food stalls and raffles will be availa
 ble for everyone to enjoy. Please be aware that alcohol is not permitted i
 n the park\; however\, you may purchase and consume it in the designated a
 rea. Visit: https://www.bwmca.com.au/jazz-in-the-park for further informat
 ion. We extend our heartfelt gratitude to our sponsors: Bendigo Community 
 Bank - Buderim Branch Brent Mickelberg MP Sunshine Coast Council Cage Secu
 rity Your Mates Brewery
